with the arrival of season 2 of apex  legends the weapon meta has changed  tremendously flipping the weapon tier  list on its head this even makes the  Mozambique a viable weapon making the  meme surrounding the gun kind of  obsolete now  ouch baby very well go over the overall  changes first then go into our opinion  about the meta in general the biggest  change so far are the two new hop ups  introduced the disruptor and the hammer  point rounds give a new twist to gunplay  making hot swapping a great tactic  depending on if the enemy has shields or  nose shields disruptor rounds attached  to the alternator and the re 45 and have  the ability to shred through armor it is  a 1.7 damage multiplier previously was  broken at 2.262 armor specifically then  ax does normal damage to non armored  opponents with the base damage and the  barrel recoil reduced even more the  alternator makes a great contender to  its big brother the r99  hammer point rounds attached to the P  2020 and the Mozambique and do regular  damage against armored opponents then  start hitting for a whopping two to two  point six times damage multiplier  against non armoured opponents if you  get your hands on both of these hop ups  with the respective weapons it's quite a  force to be reckoned with  also always remember to aim down the  sights with the Mozambique it tightens  up your pellet spread the brand new  weapon the L star is a heck of a weapon  as well but the high recoil and the  bright energy rounds may make it hard to  see the enemy remember to try and  feather your trigger halfway through the  clip so you don't overheat the weapon  the flatline received a simple damage  buff well does it make it the best gun  in the game it's not something to scoff  at it can tear through enemies quickly  as long as you can control its high  recoil energy weapons in general are  also much more viable now with larger  and most acts to carry extended energy  mags making the havoc and devotion a DPS  machine and even increase reload speeds  with blue and purple magazines shotguns  have also been balanced out not in fire  power button carry capacity with the  previous 64 shotgun rounds per stack it  would usually be able to carry you  through the game leaving tons of room  for other goodies in your bag for the  cap of 16 shots per stack now this may  make the Peacekeeper a more viable  option than the Eva eight just because  it chews through less ammo with the  previous longbow buff choke charge time  reduced for the triple take and crater  damage buff even more all snipers are  rising an overall value and add a lot  more pressure in long-range fights  in our opinion every gun has a place in  the meta now but the Aria 45 and the  alternator with the hop-up seem to rise  slightly above the rest even after the  nerf with massive damage output a close  and medium ranges there used to be a  more distinct ladder from stronger to  weaker weapons but with these newest  updates is more about better positioning  out playing your opponent and playing  with their current weapons strengths  [Music]
 

